Local policy data\policies\cw-returns.md: Cartwheel return policy

Items bought on Cartwheel can be returned within 30 days of delivery. The window counts from the delivery date, not the purchase date. Items must be in the condition described by the store's listing. Individual stores may override this window; see the store overrides policy and the store's own policy page.
Local policy data\policies\store-northwind-books-policy.md: Northwind Books store policy

Northwind Books accepts returns within 45 days of delivery, instead of the Cartwheel platform default of 30 days. This store window takes precedence for all Northwind Books orders.
Evidence assessment: Deadline is explicitly a conditional platform-default calculation with separate warning about store overrides, not an unconditional Northwind deadline.

